{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_04_beg","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_04","title":"掌櫃","storyCode":"WR-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"afc9b23eebfaf277d6f2de2d8973c2dc1762822762ffe0f9b0b7f8518cd51ecf","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"還有人沒離開這兒嗎！趕緊去先生那兒躲著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"往東邊走，快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......自從留意到天色之後就意識到，這裡真的是越往西邊走越靠近黑夜呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說的話，我們現在是“從正午走向黃昏”？還挺有詩意誒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......還是不對，這“白天到黑夜”的距離也太短了，我們才走了幾步路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"畫卷長短時有變化，各處景象光怪陸離，畫中人為自己的天地尋了一份規矩，但說到底，也是假的。這也是在所難免的事情嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我說——等等，什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"——！還有人沒離開這兒嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救、救命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"莫怕，小僧來也！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，果不其然，被斬之後便化作墨漬，怪哉怪哉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"大師，好身手哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"莫要掉以輕心，姑娘，你趕緊往東邊去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好！你們也要小心啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......似乎還有不少來不及逃走的村民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是太過突然，反應不及——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸？媽媽？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那邊有個孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不好——快趴下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......嗚啊啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦，千鈞一髮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒受傷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚......沒......嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才......剛才是不是有什麼東西刺穿了那玩意的喉嚨......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是克洛絲，真是刁鑽的角度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"她，她在哪兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"別找了，找不到的，只要知道她在就足夠了，得優先保證所有村民都離開這片黑夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，當真好默契，真讓小僧大開眼界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但我們要帶著這個小姑娘一起走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......你先帶她離開這裡，送去安全的地方，沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——我實在不忍拋下恩人，獨自避難呀！不能陪著恩人拋頭顱灑熱血，多可惜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以先把孩子送去煮傘先生那裡，然後再回來找我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......欸......好的，我會的，會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"小妹妹，跟哥哥走好不好呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......嗚嗚......叔叔，你看見我媽媽了嗎......嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥帶你去找媽媽好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......嗯......謝謝叔叔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。恩人呐，那我，先走一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，只靠嵯峨和那三位英雄，沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......無妨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民甲","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事啊？先生今天是不是心情不好？昨天忘了睡覺啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民乙","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"先生溫文爾雅，不像是個喜怒無常的人呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民甲","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"一定是先生為我們勞神操心，累了吧，我們應當多為他著想點，讓他睡著吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"六根清淨！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斬卻煩惱！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"油炸豆腐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎，嘎啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還挺厲害的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧自幼在寺廟長大，耳濡目染，稍微學了些刀法罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你這叫稍微？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"莫要在意，待小僧為炎熔施主開出一條道來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......嘎啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那些怪物已經開始怕你了......說起來，墨魎是有智慧的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎！嘎啊！嘎啊嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼停手了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎，嘎嘎啊，嘎啊嘎啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯嗯，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！？你還能聽懂這玩意說話的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"略通一二。施主你看，這一隻墨魎也沒犯什麼過錯，若是真心悔過，不再侵擾鎮上鄰里，放了就放了罷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，小僧自有分寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近安靜些了......應該沒有其他村民留在這裡，現在我們可以談談了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔施主好生嚴肅，莫非小僧做錯了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒沒有，只是你剛才說了......畫卷？你似乎對這裡很瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不，小僧在此地雲遊，也有段時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這地方看上去可不值得“雲遊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"一幅畫卷，能有多大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思......我們在畫裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"正是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......到底什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，小僧明白了，幾位施主和小僧一樣，也是誤入此中山河——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"想當初，小僧只是途經大炎勾吳地界，突發奇想，想去拜訪一下那位大家後人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"見灰齊山飛瀑之下美不勝收，就在一處山中茅屋露宿一宿，沒想到眼睛一閉一睜，就到這裡來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，什麼意思，你也是來找“夕”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"夕？小僧倒未曾聽說過這個名諱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧尋的，是那位“一筆拙山起，何處話風流”的炎國畫家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不過算算時日，怕那畫家已經不在人世了，故而想去探訪其故居，如此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你也是先去大炎勾吳灰齊山，然後莫名其妙就到了這裡的，對吧！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，確是如此不假，但施主為何如此激動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你說這裡是畫卷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"天地人皆不合情理，炎熔施主，沒有意識到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這我也知道，可為什麼是畫......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧也難說明白，不過這婆山鎮，已經是小僧遊歷的......大概百餘幅畫卷啦！至少自己身在何處，還是心知肚明的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"可......那些人，是活生生的人，茶水有滋味，水果也能吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"只是某種法術的結果嗎？可如果這是法術的結果......這是什麼樣的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"這小僧可就毫無頭緒了。要不是曾有幸一瞥這天地真實，小僧怕也意識不到自己身在何處吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"此處沒有天災所擾，各界生靈，都遵循著自己的規矩，自成方圓，妙不可言。小僧留在這裡，未嘗沒有圖個安心的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，看施主一臉困惑，也在所難免，小僧初見夕娥的時候，也是施主這般模樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著......你說見誰！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧見了——等等，那處燈火，莫非是掌櫃的當鋪？她竟然沒去避難，這可不成！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"等等我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了好了，別這麼激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要來嚇唬人？她是怎麼說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是這樣......她還是老樣子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃的，你沒事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事的......這位就是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，這位施主就是炎熔，是之前傳得沸沸揚揚的外來者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"幸會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是這間當鋪的老闆娘，單名一個“黎”字，黎明的黎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......你沒有被奇怪的東西襲擊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"黎姑娘，不知那些墨魎是不是還會回來，可否讓我們躲藏在此處，觀察一二？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["烏有"]}]}
